{"3796830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phantom Playhouse", "steam_appid": 3796830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHANTOM PLAYHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay alive in this horror adventure. Survive the unsettling Animatronics that lurk in the darkness. Use an old console to play a mysterious cartridge, solve puzzles, and face each night with caution. Uncover the hidden truth… and don’t let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Funtime Park</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funtime Park was a colorful family entertainment and show park, famous for its unique animatronics and unforgettable performances. But a mysterious fire destroyed everything… and no one ever spoke of the place again. Years later, only an old cartridge remains. Playing it might be the only way to discover what really happened among the laughter, lights… and darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Animatronics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The animatronics of Funtime Park were once the stars of the show! Among them are Specter, the silent and loyal canine companion, and Veil, a swift and graceful wolf who charmed the audience. But now, something has changed. If you encounter them while playing, stay calm... Maybe they just want to play with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Console</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the room, the console awaits to be used. During the night, you’ll need to play it to make the hours pass. A simple platformer game of jumping and collecting balloons. Complete each level if you want to see the sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/ef1cdf265e38ca1e6b056f68f93426d8.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/ef1cdf265e38ca1e6b056f68f93426d8.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/ef1cdf265e38ca1e6b056f68f93426d8.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flaslight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the night covers everything, the flashlight becomes your best ally. Its light is the only thing that lets you see in the darkness, so use it carefully... Sometimes, what hides in the shadows doesn’t want to be seen, but if you don’t see it first, it will be too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/dd7b25cc396be34092bfbf418886ae25.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/dd7b25cc396be34092bfbf418886ae25.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/dd7b25cc396be34092bfbf418886ae25.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to enter Phantom Playhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what you were never meant to find...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHANTOM PLAYHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must stay alive in this horror adventure. Survive the unsettling Animatronics that lurk in the darkness. Use an old console to play a mysterious cartridge, solve puzzles, and face each night with caution. Uncover the hidden truth… and don’t let your guard down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Funtime Park</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funtime Park was a colorful family entertainment and show park, famous for its unique animatronics and unforgettable performances. But a mysterious fire destroyed everything… and no one ever spoke of the place again. Years later, only an old cartridge remains. Playing it might be the only way to discover what really happened among the laughter, lights… and darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Animatronics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The animatronics of Funtime Park were once the stars of the show! Among them are Specter, the silent and loyal canine companion, and Veil, a swift and graceful wolf who charmed the audience. But now, something has changed. If you encounter them while playing, stay calm... Maybe they just want to play with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Console</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the room, the console awaits to be used. During the night, you’ll need to play it to make the hours pass. A simple platformer game of jumping and collecting balloons. Complete each level if you want to see the sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/ef1cdf265e38ca1e6b056f68f93426d8.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/ef1cdf265e38ca1e6b056f68f93426d8.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/ef1cdf265e38ca1e6b056f68f93426d8.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flaslight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the night covers everything, the flashlight becomes your best ally. Its light is the only thing that lets you see in the darkness, so use it carefully... Sometimes, what hides in the shadows doesn’t want to be seen, but if you don’t see it first, it will be too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/dd7b25cc396be34092bfbf418886ae25.poster.avif?t=1761228330\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/dd7b25cc396be34092bfbf418886ae25.webm?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796830/extras/dd7b25cc396be34092bfbf418886ae25.mp4?t=1761228330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to enter Phantom Playhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what you were never meant to find...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You must stay alive in this horror adventure. Survive the unsettling Animatronics lurking in the dark. Use an old console to play a mysterious cartridge, solve puzzles, and face each night with caution. Uncover the hidden truth… and don’t let your guard down.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets